{#
integration/_scrubber.html.twig — the date bar down the right of the photo grid.

Segments are sized by how many photos each month holds, so the bar shows the
shape of the library rather than treating a busy month and an empty one alike.
Those counts come from one cheap API call, which is what makes jumping to a
month that has never been loaded instant.

Two things this has to get right, both learned the hard way:

Height. Buckets are monthly, so a twenty-year library is ~240 segments. Giving
each a minimum height made the bar taller than the grid beside it and pushed it
through the footer. Segments are now purely proportional and the bar clips, so it
can never exceed the row it sits in. A thin month is a thin target — that is what
dragging is for, and the readout says where you are.

Labels. Rendered as an absolutely positioned overlay at each year's cumulative
offset, not inside the segments. Inside, a one-pixel December spilled its label
over its neighbours and the early years came out stacked on top of each other. A
year is skipped if it would land too close to the last one drawn.
#}
{% set total = buckets|reduce((sum, bucket) => sum + bucket.count, 0) %}

{% if total > 0 %}
    <div class="hidden sm:flex shrink-0 w-12 flex-col border-l border-line select-none overflow-hidden"
         data-controller="picker-scrubber"
         aria-label="{{ 'integration.picker.timeline'|trans }}">

        <div class="relative flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col overflow-hidden">
            {# Floats outside the bar so a thin segment can still show a legible
               label. #}
            <span data-picker-scrubber-target="readout"
                  class="pointer-events-none absolute right-full mr-2 z-20 hidden
                         whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-inverse px-2 py-1
                         text-[11px] font-medium text-inverse-ink shadow-float"></span>

            {% set running = 0 %}
            {% set lastLabel = null %}
            {# Percent of the bar's height that must separate two labels. About
               one line of 9px text in a 55vh bar. #}
            {% set labelGap = 3.2 %}
            {% set lastLabelAt = -100 %}

            {% for bucket in buckets %}
                {% set offset = running / total * 100 %}
                {% set running = running + bucket.count %}

                <a href="{{ path('app_integration_browse', {
                       id: integration.id,
                       folder: 'timeline',
                       draft: draftId,
                       cursor: bucket.cursor,
                   }) }}"
                   data-picker-scrubber-target="segment"
                   data-title="{{ bucket.title }}"
                   data-action="mouseenter->picker-scrubber#show mouseleave->picker-scrubber#hide"
                   style="flex-grow: {{ bucket.count }}"
                   class="basis-0 shrink hover:bg-hover transition-colors"
                   title="{{ bucket.title }}"
                   aria-label="{{ bucket.title }}"></a>

                {% if bucket.label != lastLabel and offset - lastLabelAt >= labelGap %}
                    <span class="pointer-events-none absolute right-1 z-10 text-[9px] tabular-nums text-ink-faint"
                          style="top: {{ offset|round(2) }}%">{{ bucket.label }}</span>
                    {% set lastLabelAt = offset %}
                {% endif %}

                {% set lastLabel = bucket.label %}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
{% endif %}
